  {
    "element_type": "heading",
    "text": "​1. Overview​",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": 2,
    "heading_path": [
      "​TECSACK SOFTWARE​",
      "​1. Overview​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf",
      "font_size": 19.99,
      "bold": true
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​PoolingAutomationSynergy is an enterprise desktop application built to​\n​automate merchant fund pooling, ACH-based payment processing, and​\n​cash flow management for organizations that consolidate funds across​\n​multiple merchant accounts, client groups, or business locations.​",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​TECSACK SOFTWARE​",
      "​1. Overview​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​The application gives finance and treasury teams a single, integrated​\n​system to calculate pooled amounts, move funds through the ACH network,​\n​track payment status end-to-end, reconcile pooled versus processed​\n​amounts, and generate and distribute financial reports — all from one​\n​desktop workspace.​",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​TECSACK SOFTWARE​",
      "​1. Overview​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "heading",
    "text": "​2. Business Context​",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": 2,
    "heading_path": [
      "​TECSACK SOFTWARE​",
      "​2. Business Context​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf",
      "font_size": 19.99,
      "bold": true
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​Organizations that manage many merchant accounts or business locations​\n​typically need to:​",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​TECSACK SOFTWARE​",
      "​2. Business Context​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​•​ ​Consolidate (“pool”) funds across those accounts regularly​",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​TECSACK SOFTWARE​",
      "​2. Business Context​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​•​ ​Move the resulting funds through ACH payment processing​",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​TECSACK SOFTWARE​",
      "​2. Business Context​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​•​ ​Track the status of every payment leg, including rejections and corrections​",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​TECSACK SOFTWARE​",
      "​2. Business Context​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​•​ ​Reconcile what was pooled against what was actually processed​",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​TECSACK SOFTWARE​",
      "​2. Business Context​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​•​ ​Produce accurate, auditable financial reports for internal and client use​",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​TECSACK SOFTWARE​",
      "​2. Business Context​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​Handling this manually across many merchant accounts is time-consuming and​\n​error-prone. PoolingAutomationSynergy centralizes the entire workflow — from​\n​pooling calculation through payment processing, reconciliation, and reporting —​\n​into a single, purpose-built system.​",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​TECSACK SOFTWARE​",
      "​2. Business Context​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "heading",
    "text": "​3. Key Capabilities​",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": 1,
    "heading_path": [
      "​3. Key Capabilities​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf",
      "font_size": 19.99,
