    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​3. Key Capabilities​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​Secure User Access​\n​Authenticated login and a centralized navigation​\n​dashboard​",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​3. Key Capabilities​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​Client & Merchant​\n​Management​",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​3. Key Capabilities​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​Maintain client groups, individual merchant records, and​\n​banking details​",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​3. Key Capabilities​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​Pooling Calculation Engine​\n​Calculate pooled amounts by client, location, or hybrid​\n​grouping over a selected period​",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​3. Key Capabilities​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​ACH Payment Processing​\n​Generate, submit, track, and correct ACH payment files​\n​across multiple provider formats​",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​3. Key Capabilities​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​Cash Flow Reporting​\n​On-demand, parameterized cash flow reports​",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​3. Key Capabilities​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​Reconciliation & Audit​\n​Compare pooled vs. processed amounts, with a full​\n​change-history audit trail​",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​3. Key Capabilities​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​Automated Report​\n​Distribution​",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​3. Key Capabilities​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​Route generated reports to client contacts by email, with a​\n​delivery log​",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​3. Key Capabilities​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​Administrative Controls​\n​Password-gated access to sensitive banking configuration,​\n​plus a live operational summary dashboard​",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​3. Key Capabilities​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
