    "heading_path": [
      "​4. Functional Modules​",
      "​4.1 Login & Navigation​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf",
      "font_size": 16.99,
      "bold": true
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​Users authenticate through a secure login screen. Once signed in, they​\n​land on a central dashboard that serves as both an operational summary​\n​and the primary navigation hub for every workflow in the application, giving​\n​users quick access to client management, pooling controls, ACH​\n​processing, reporting, and administration from one place.​",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​4. Functional Modules​",
      "​4.1 Login & Navigation​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
